WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.280
Watch and read: While at the market, Ama thinks about this: Which word joins similar

00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:05.619
ideas?

00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:09.373
The answer is: and. And adds a related idea.

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:15.527
Watch and read: Kojo is learning with a partner at school. Which word shows contrast?

00:00:16.367 --> 00:00:19.929
The answer is: but. But introduces a contrasting idea.
